And moving on to our last phrase, we said that it was a great idea that we're going to the park and getting fresh air because we don't go to the gym anymore.

135
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:48,920
Okay. Now this is a really important phrase to keep as a phrase.

136
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:50,480
First of all, we have a gym.

137
00:07:50,780 --> 00:07:51,760
