140
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:56,770
You exercise. Maybe you run on the treadmill or you lift weights.

141
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:01,000
But it's important to remember that the verb here is to go to the gym.

142
00:08:01,390 --> 00:08:04,390
So I could say I go to the gym three times a week.

143
00:08:04,570 --> 00:08:05,950
